#: ../../tools/humanbase_tools.rst:32 87a8db798b154e1ba48f267df72654e2
msgid ""
"**Description**: Retrieve tissue-specific protein-protein interactions "
"and biological processes from HumanBase. Returns a NetworkX graph of "
"tissue specific protein-protein interactions and a list of associated "
"biological processes involeed by the given genes from Gene Ontology."
msgstr ""
"**描述**：从HumanBase中检索组织特异性蛋白质-蛋白质相互作用和生物学过程。返回一个包含组织特异性蛋白质-蛋白质相互作用的NetworkX图，以及一个由Gene"
" Ontology提供的与给定基因相关的生物学过程列表。"

#: ../../tools/humanbase_tools.rst:34 19447b7cf9534e8093d7ade08aa3bfc1
msgid "**Parameters:**"
msgstr "**参数：**"

#: ../../tools/humanbase_tools.rst:36 b562d4ae9fa84425a48ff78289d0004e
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``gene_list`` (array) (optional) List of gene names or symbols to analyze"
" for protein-protein interactions. The gene name should be the official "
"gene symbol, not the synonym."
msgstr "``gene_list``（数组）（必填项）用于分析蛋白质-蛋白质相互作用的基因名称或符号列表。基因名称应使用官方基因符号，而非同义词。"

#: ../../tools/humanbase_tools.rst:39 a1e4509e770f4cfcb019a22e9441a1d3
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``tissue`` (string) (optional) Tissue type for tissue-specific "
"interactions. Use simple names like 'brain', 'heart', 'liver', 'kidney', "
"'lung', 'blood'. For v3 networks with more cell-type specificity, append "
"'-v3' (e.g., 'brain-v3', 'liver-v3')."
msgstr "``tissue``（字符串）（可选）用于特定组织交互的组织类型。例如：'brain'（大脑）、'heart'（心脏）、'liver'（肝脏）、'kidney'（肾脏）等。"

#: ../../tools/humanbase_tools.rst:42 f0aaaf1ca5fb450292f33a269eac7a76
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``max_node`` (integer) (optional) Maximum number of nodes to retrieve in "
"the interaction network. Warning: the more nodes, the more time it takes "
"to retrieve the data. Default is 10 (~30 seconds)."
msgstr "``max_node``（整数）（可选）交互网络中要检索的最大节点数。注意：节点数量越多，检索数据所需时间越长。默认值为10（约30秒）。"

#: ../../tools/humanbase_tools.rst:45 9c9f774078354f339509cf2a7512e711
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``interaction`` (string) (optional) Specific interaction type to filter "
"by. Available types: 'co-expression', 'interaction', 'tf-binding', 'gsea-"
"microrna-targets', 'gsea-perturbations'. If not specified, all types will"
" be included."
msgstr ""
"``interaction``（字符串）（可选）用于筛选的特定交互类型。可用类型包括：'co-expression'、'interaction"
"'、'tf-binding'、'gsea-microrna-targets'、'gsea-"
"perturbations'。如果未指定，将包含所有类型。"

#: ../../tools/humanbase_tools.rst:48 82e54d87a7fe4b0dae655d3726e15908
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``string_mode`` (boolean) (optional) Whether to return the result in "
"string mode. If True, the result will be a string of the network graph "
"and the biological processes. If False, the result will be a NetworkX "
"graph and a list of biological processes."
msgstr ""
"``string_mode``（布尔值）（可选）是否以字符串模式返回结果。如果为 True，结果将是网络图和生物过程的字符串。如果为 "
"False，结果将是一个 NetworkX 图和一个生物过程列表。"

#: ../../tools/humanbase_tools.rst:51 3713cbc25dd1457b9383f4555bf78e4f
msgid ""
"``genes`` (array) (optional) Alias for gene\\_list. List of gene symbols "
"to analyze."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/humanbase_tools.rst:54 4a505ce4a3ed44caa1a2fba1385e9625
msgid ""
"``top_n`` (integer) (optional) Alias for max\\_node. Maximum number of "
"network nodes to retrieve."
msgstr ""

